#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:2
msgid "Choose a Conversation Mode"
msgstr "选择对话模式"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:4
msgid ""
"The composer offers four modes. The mode influences how much planning and"
" tool-driven execution Studio expects from the request; it does not "
"remove the need to review changes."
msgstr "Composer 提供四种模式。模式会影响 Studio 对请求所需规划程度和工具驱动执行的预期，但不会免除审查变更的必要。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:12
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:13
msgid "Use it when"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:14
msgid "What to expect"
msgstr "预期行为"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:15
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "Ask"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:16
msgid "You want an explanation, recommendation, or answer."
msgstr "你需要解释、建议或答案。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:17
msgid "Prefer this for read-only discussion and focused questions."
msgstr "只读讨论和有针对性的问题优先使用此模式。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:18
msgid "Agent"
msgstr "Agent"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:19
msgid "You want the agent to inspect or complete a bounded task."
msgstr "你希望 agent 检查或完成一个范围明确的任务。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:20
msgid "The agent may use tools, make approved edits, and run targeted checks."
msgstr "agent 可以使用工具、执行已批准的编辑，并运行有针对性的检查。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:21
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "Plan"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:22
msgid "You know the outcome but want to review the sequence before execution."
msgstr "你知道期望结果，但希望在执行前审查工作步骤。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:23
msgid "Studio builds a plan that you can revise before allowing implementation."
msgstr "Studio 会生成一份计划，你可以在允许实施前修改它。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:24
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "Goal"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:25
msgid "You have a larger objective that may require several stages."
msgstr "你有一个可能需要多个阶段才能完成的较大目标。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:26
msgid ""
"Studio tracks progress, checkpoints, Todo items, approvals, and "
"verification across a longer run."
msgstr "Studio 会在较长的运行过程中跟踪进度、检查点、Todo 项、审批和验证。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:30
msgid "Practical selection guide"
msgstr "实用选择指南"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:32
msgid ""
"Start with **Ask** when you are still learning what is wrong. Switch to "
"**Plan** when the change crosses several systems or files. Use **Agent** "
"for a small, well-scoped implementation. Use **Goal** when you can "
"describe the outcome but expect discovery, multiple edits, and repeated "
"verification."
msgstr "还在了解问题时，从 **Ask** 开始。变更涉及多个系统或文件时，切换到 **Plan**。小型且范围明确的实现使用 **Agent**。能够描述结果，但预计需要探索、多次编辑和反复验证时，使用 **Goal**。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:37
msgid "You can state a constraint in any mode, for example:"
msgstr "你可以在任何模式中声明约束，例如："

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:39
msgid "“Read only; do not modify files.”"
msgstr "“只读；不要修改文件。”"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:40
msgid "“Propose the scene patch first and wait for approval.”"
msgstr "“先提议场景补丁，等待审批。”"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:41
msgid "“Keep the public API unchanged and run the existing tests.”"
msgstr "“保持公共 API 不变，并运行现有测试。”"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:42
msgid "“Stop if the required Godot version is not available.”"
msgstr "“如果所需的 Godot 版本不可用，就停止。”"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:45
msgid "Writing effective requests"
msgstr "编写有效请求"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:47
msgid "Include four pieces when possible:"
msgstr "尽可能包含四项内容："

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:49
msgid "the desired behavior or outcome;"
msgstr "期望的行为或结果；"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:50
msgid "the relevant project area or file;"
msgstr "相关项目区域或文件；"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:51
msgid "constraints such as compatibility, style, or files that must not change;"
msgstr "兼容性、风格或不得修改的文件等约束；"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:52
msgid "the check that should prove the result."
msgstr "能够证明结果的检查。"

#: ../../source/agent/modes.rst:54
msgid ""
"The more concrete the acceptance condition, the easier it is to tell "
"whether the final verification actually answers your request."
msgstr "验收条件越具体，就越容易判断最终验证是否真正回答了你的请求。"
